Subject: WebGL2: Suppress framebuffer-render-to-layer.html on Windows D3D11

Suppress conformance2/rendering/framebuffer-render-to-layer.html on
Windows D3D11, as D3D11 does not support simultaneously binding a 3D
color attachment and a 2D depth/stencil attachment. (This change is needed to fix the cq dry run of https://chromium-review.git.corp.google.com/c/angle/angle/+/8594325)

